---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Privacy policy for this static affiliate content site."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: October 28, 2026 (America/New_York).</em></p>
    <p>
      This site is a <strong>static</strong> website. Pages are HTML files served by a host such as
      GitHub Pages or Cloudflare Pages. There is no account system and no first-party comment form.
    </p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server / CDN logs:</strong> the host (e.g. GitHub, Cloudflare, Netlify) may log IP
        address, user agent, and requested URLs for security and operations. That is controlled by
        their privacy policies, not by custom code on this site.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics:</strong> none are embedded at launch. If analytics are added later, this
        page will be updated before they go live.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Affiliate / outbound clicks:</strong> when you follow an affiliate or retailer link,
        that merchant or network (Amazon, Sephora/Rakuten, Rytr, etc.) may set cookies and process
        data under <em>their</em> policies. This site does not receive your purchase details beyond
        aggregated commission reports from those programs.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This static site does not set first-party tracking cookies. Third-party sites you visit via
      outbound links may set their own cookies.
    </p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions related to this site, use the contact options on
      <a href="https://linktr.ee/chadd990" rel="noopener">linktr.ee/chadd990</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
